#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:9
msgid "USB Host、HS DMA 与角色切换"
msgstr "USB Host, HS DMA, and role switching"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:11
msgid ""
"共享准入与停止见[USB生命周期](usb-lifecycle.md)。HS Device与Host共享控制器的AHB "
"DMA限制在本页一次维护；上层协议栈接线见[中间件](usb-middleware.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See the [USB lifecycle](usb-lifecycle.md) for shared admission and stopping."
" This page owns the AHB DMA restrictions shared by HS Device and Host "
"controllers. See [middleware](usb-middleware.md) for upper-layer protocol-"
"stack wiring."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:13
msgid "HS AHB DMA、Host 与 managed role"
msgstr "HS AHB DMA, Host and managed roles"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:15
msgid ""
"HS Device DMA 使用每方向静态 SRAM staging 和独立 24 B SETUP staging；CPU 复制 公共 "
"payload，不要求它额外声明 DMA word padding。AHB master 不占 DMA2 stream， CCM 不可选。完成还必须证明"
" endpoint disabled、AHB idle、DMA 地址撤回读回和 IRQ 会合；失败保持 QUARANTINED，不能只看 XFRC 或 "
"timeout 释放调用者存储。"
msgstr ""
"HS Device DMA uses static SRAM staging per direction and separate 24 B SETUP"
" staging. The CPU copies public payloads without requiring callers to "
"declare additional DMA word padding. The AHB master occupies no DMA2 stream;"
" CCM cannot be selected. Completion also requires proof that the endpoint is"
" disabled, AHB is idle, DMA addresses have been withdrawn with successful "
"readback, and IRQ observers have joined. Failure retains QUARANTINED "
"storage; XFRC or timeout alone cannot release caller storage."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:20
msgid ""
"Host 公共操作使用装配局部的 `nx_usb_host_pipe_id_t`，与 endpoint 地址和物理 HCD channel "
"独立。默认逻辑 pipe 与所选 channel 同序，不生成映射数组；可选 `pipe_channels` 是长度为 "
"`channel_count`、元素为 0 至 `channel_count-1` 的排列。 固定 Host 和 managed role 的 Host"
" 共用该配置。映射为只读数据，必须存活到完整冷态 停止后；改变映射前须退出全部 packet、IRQ 和角色使用者。"
msgstr ""
"Public Host operations use assembly-local `nx_usb_host_pipe_id_t` "
"identities, independently of endpoint addresses and physical HCD channels. "
"The default preserves selected-channel order and generates no mapping array."
" Optional `pipe_channels` is a permutation of zero through "
"`channel_count-1`, containing `channel_count` entries. Fixed Host and "
"managed-role Host use the same configuration. The mapping is readonly and "
"remains live through complete cold stop. All packet, IRQ and role users must"
" exit before it changes."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:26
msgid ""
"F4 在 open、close、submit、cancel 边界执行一次逻辑到物理转换；HAL callback、 硬件排空和保存的 request "
"始终使用物理 slot，不进行反向搜索。每个所选 Host 的只读 配置增加一个指针；只有显式映射生成每 pipe 一字节的只读数组，没有新增可变队列、"
" 反向表或全局设备注册。准入拒绝 request／payload 与活跃配置或映射的已知重叠。"
msgstr ""
"F4 translates logical to physical identity once at the open, close, submit "
"and cancel boundaries. HAL callbacks, hardware withdrawal and retained "
"requests always use physical slots without reverse searches. Each selected "
"Host adds one pointer to readonly configuration. Only an explicit mapping "
"generates one readonly byte per pipe; no mutable queue, reverse table or "
"global device registry is added. Admission rejects known overlaps of "
"requests or payloads with the live configuration or mapping."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:31
msgid ""
"Host 每个所选 pipe 同时借用一个 packet。打开 pipe 后，调用者按 payload 长度查询 "
"`nx_usb_host_storage_requirements`，取得包含完整访问范围的 capacity 和地址 alignment； 零长 "
"OUT 也查询真实最小范围。查询不访问外设 MMIO，不准入或借用存储，也不授予 DMA 可达性。缺少可选查询返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED，调用者不得猜测默认几何。"
msgstr ""
"Each selected Host pipe borrows one packet at a time. After opening a pipe, "
"callers query `nx_usb_host_storage_requirements` for the payload length to "
"obtain capacity covering all accesses and address alignment. Zero-length OUT"
" also queries its true minimum extent. The query performs no peripheral "
"MMIO, admission or storage borrow and grants no DMA reachability. An absent "
"optional query returns UNSUPPORTED; callers must not guess default geometry."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:36
msgid ""
"F4 provider 的 PIO 地址 alignment 为 1，OUT 范围按四字节取整，IN 覆盖四字节取整的 MPS；HS DMA 的地址 "
"alignment 为 4，零长 OUT 仍需四字节可读范围。实际 DMA 地址还 必须通过原有内存域检查。查询与 submit "
"共享同一范围计算；查询输出不得覆盖活跃 配置、映射、request、payload 或 managed role 保留的非活动 Device 元数据。 "
"普通公共 prepare 合同不包含这些 F4 编码规则。"
msgstr ""
"The F4 PIO provider requires address alignment one, rounds OUT extents to "
"four bytes and covers the MPS rounded to four bytes for IN. HS DMA requires "
"address alignment four and four readable bytes even for zero-length OUT. "
"Actual DMA addresses still pass the existing memory-domain validation. Query"
" and submit share the same extent calculation. Query output must not "
"overwrite live configuration, mappings, requests, payloads or inactive "
"Device metadata retained by a managed role. The ordinary public prepare "
"contract contains none of these F4 encoding rules."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:42
msgid ""
"官方 Host bridge 在每次 packet 的复制／补零／准入前消费查询结果，验证既有 staging 的容量和对齐；OUT "
"只补零声明的额外访问范围。调用者继续提供精确存储预算，桥接 不自动分配或扩容，也不强制全部后端使用 1024 B 最小存储或四字节对齐。此查询增加 "
"一个可选只读 ops 项及所选代码，没有新增 provider 可变字段、队列或缓冲区。"
msgstr ""
"The official Host bridge consumes the query before copying, padding or "
"admitting each packet, validating the capacity and alignment of existing "
"staging. OUT zeros only the declared extra access extent. Callers still "
"supply exact storage budgets; the bridge neither allocates nor expands them "
"and does not require every backend to use a 1024-byte minimum or four-byte "
"alignment. The query adds one optional readonly ops entry and selected code,"
" without new provider mutable fields, queues or buffers."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:47
msgid ""
"NAK／NYET 返回 NACK，由协议 owner 明确重试。锁定 HCD 的回调只锁存事实； 取消／超时保守排空整个共享 FIFO "
"controller。旧物理 slot、DMA 地址、FIFO 和 IRQ 全部退出才 SETTLED。Host 没有自动 hub split 策略。"
msgstr ""
"NAK/NYET returns NACK for explicit protocol-owner retry. The pinned HCD "
"callback only latches facts. Cancellation and timeout conservatively drain "
"the entire shared-FIFO controller. Old physical slots, DMA addresses, FIFOs "
"and IRQ references must exit before SETTLED. Host does not provide automatic"
" hub split policy."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:51
msgid ""
"Host control pipe 的 MPS 按实际速度准入：low-speed 为 8，full-speed 为 8／16／32／64，high-"
"speed 为 64；非法组合在 HAL 和 channel 副作用前拒绝。 reset／resume 在任何 HPRT 写入前分别要求严格多于 10 "
"ms／20 ms 加 1 µs 的剩余 deadline；额外一 tick 覆盖整数微秒采样隐藏的相位。不足、已到期或恰好耗尽预算 时返回 "
"TIMEOUT，不发出短复位／恢复脉冲。"
msgstr ""
"Host control-pipe MPS admission follows the actual speed: 8 at low speed, "
"8/16/32/64 at full speed and 64 at high speed. Invalid combinations are "
"rejected before HAL or channel effects. Before any HPRT write, reset/resume "
"require strictly more than 10 ms/20 ms plus a 1 us guard remaining. The "
"extra tick covers the fractional phase hidden by integer-microsecond "
"samples. Insufficient, expired or exactly exhausted budgets return TIMEOUT "
"without issuing a short reset/resume pulse."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:57
msgid ""
"已经开始的 reset／resume 必须保持最低信号时间。抢占越过 deadline 时，先完成 最低保持与撤信号读回，再返回 "
"TIMEOUT；实际已恢复时仍发布 resumed 状态。 撤信号失败进入 closing，保留原 controller／clock 责任，stop "
"首先重试信号撤回， 成功前不调用 HAL stop 或释放 gate。已开始信号的时钟倒退、无效或持续无进展， 以有限观察预算进入 fault "
"observer 和不返回的 park，保留信号而不伪造最低保持。 不增加实例字段、后台任务或另一套时钟；这些软件检查不构成物理脉宽测量。"
msgstr ""
"Once reset/resume starts, its minimum signal duration must be maintained. If"
" preemption crosses the deadline, the provider completes the minimum hold "
"and verifies signal withdrawal before returning TIMEOUT; an actually resumed"
" port still publishes its resumed state. Failed withdrawal closes admission "
"and retains the original controller/clock responsibility. Stop first retries"
" signal withdrawal and does not call HAL stop or release the gate before it "
"succeeds. Backward, invalid or persistently stalled time during an admitted "
"signal reaches the fault observer and a non-returning park within a finite "
"observation budget, retaining the signal without inventing minimum-duration "
"proof. No instance fields, background tasks or second clock are added. These"
" software checks do not measure physical pulse widths."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-host.md:64
msgid ""
"`Nexus::USBRole` 是通用供电和排空屏障，F407 managed OTG 将它接入真实 cold Device／Host。一个 "
"composite 独占 core、PHY、pins、clock 和 IRQ；OFF prepare 不启动 USB。显式 generation-"
"bound 请求先真实 drain，再 source-off 读回和独立 VBUS 放电确认，才进行新角色的供电／cold prepare。切回 "
"Device 等待至少 50 ms 并确认实际 CMOD；inactive face 纯拒绝，旧 SETUP epoch 不跨角色复用。过流通过 显式 "
"service 进入同一撤回屏障；硬件限流与实际放电路径由外部电源 owner 提供。 详见 "
"`tests/integration/assemblies/usb_otg_assembly/README.md` 的软件信号合同。"
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::USBRole` is a common power and drain barrier; F407 managed OTG "
"connects it to actual cold Device/Host owners. One composite exclusively "
"owns the core, PHY, pins, clock and IRQ. OFF prepare does not start USB. "
"Explicit generation-bound requests first perform an actual drain, then "
"confirm source-off readback and independently verify VBUS discharge before "
"powering and cold-preparing the new role. Returning to Device waits at least"
" 50 ms and confirms actual CMOD. An inactive face rejects without effects, "
"and old SETUP epochs are not reused across roles. Explicit service routes "
"overcurrent through the same withdrawal barrier; the external power owner "
"supplies hardware current limiting and the actual discharge path. See the "
"software signal contract in "
"`tests/integration/assemblies/usb_otg_assembly/README.md`."
